Where the hell are you, Kaido?

266
00:20:25,440 --> 00:20:27,200
Ugh, that little bastard.

267
00:20:27,480 --> 00:20:28,460
I'll kill him.

268
00:20:31,320 --> 00:20:32,960
Kyo, kyo, kyo, kyo.

269
00:20:33,280 --> 00:20:35,800
It's been ten years since then.

270
00:20:36,620 --> 00:20:40,200
Now you've become a one-man army, Kaido.

271
00:20:40,660 --> 00:20:42,080
Kyo, kyo, kyo.

272
00:20:42,560 --> 00:20:44,360
Throughout all of history,

273
00:20:44,840 --> 00:20:49,340
mankind has turned to violence
to solve every problem they face.

274
00:20:49,900 --> 00:20:52,140
As well they should, I say.

275
00:20:52,720 --> 00:20:54,480
We're animals, after all.

276
00:20:54,700 --> 00:20:57,800
The strong have always conquered the weak.

277
00:20:58,040 --> 00:20:59,717
Of course, but what's your point?

278
00:20:59,800 --> 00:21:04,397
The other remnants of the rocks pirates
will grow in power, too, I'm sure.

279
00:21:04,480 --> 00:21:10,180
Weapons will decide the future
And I have plenty to spare

280
00:21:12,440 --> 00:21:17,557
The self-appointed rulers of this
world preach peace And they claim

281
00:21:17,640 --> 00:21:21,537
that power is their birthright
We'll drag them from their thrones

282
00:21:21,620 --> 00:21:22,717
And on to the

283
00:21:22,800 --> 00:21:29,717
battlefield A person's

284
00:21:29,800 --> 00:21:30,997
worth should be determined by

285
00:21:31,080 --> 00:21:35,740
strength That is the only way to
ensure true justice and freedom!

286
00:21:41,280 --> 00:21:44,060
Sorry, but nothing's gonna stop me now!

287
00:22:01,600 --> 00:22:03,800
I heard Yamato talking about Joy Boy.

288
00:22:04,240 --> 00:22:07,475
As for where he learned that
name, I couldn't tell you.

289
00:22:08,140 --> 00:22:12,900
But I know Odin was waiting until he
appeared to open up the borders of Wano.

290
00:22:13,840 --> 00:22:16,428
You're waiting for him
yourself, aren't you?

291
00:22:16,760 --> 00:22:17,995
That's what you said.

292
00:22:18,640 --> 00:22:22,680
In that case, I know
exactly who Joy Boy is.

293
00:22:45,680 --> 00:22:48,220
I cannot afford to be distracted again.

294
00:22:48,600 --> 00:22:51,020
I must trust that Luque will triumph!

295
00:22:52,040 --> 00:22:53,180
That's the spirit!

296
00:22:53,820 --> 00:22:55,460
Save the land of Wano!

297
00:22:55,740 --> 00:22:57,320
Set its people free!

298
00:22:57,920 --> 00:22:59,797
Make those clowns!

299
00:22:59,880 --> 00:23:01,580
I know you can do it!

300
00:23:03,580 --> 00:23:05,820
Come forth, flame clouds!

301
00:23:06,160 --> 00:23:07,380
Heave my coal!

302
00:23:20,820 --> 00:23:22,540
The hell is that noise?

303
00:23:28,580 --> 00:23:31,820
No fire can withstand this!

304
00:23:42,500 --> 00:23:46,560
The waters of soul shall deliver you!

305
00:23:59,480 --> 00:24:00,760
Whoa! Water!

306
00:24:01,660 --> 00:24:04,077
It's like they're raining
down from the sky!

307
00:24:04,160 --> 00:24:05,660
Wait, that nose!

308
00:24:07,060 --> 00:24:08,097
Don't die!

309
00:24:08,180 --> 00:24:09,020
Stay with me!

310
00:24:09,580 --> 00:24:11,200
Move up! Give them all!

311
00:24:11,420 --> 00:24:12,302
I'll kick them!

312
00:24:26,320 --> 00:24:31,097
I'm sorry you've had
to endure so much pain

313
00:24:31,180 --> 00:24:36,317
for years and years

314
00:24:36,400 --> 00:24:38,380
you've remained strong

315
00:24:40,680 --> 00:24:46,480
I almost lost you there hey
don't get washed away come back

316
00:24:48,500 --> 00:24:50,240
Where'd this water come from?

317
00:24:51,260 --> 00:24:52,840
Whoa, whoa, whoa!

318
00:24:53,640 --> 00:24:54,760
Awesome A!

319
00:24:59,940 --> 00:25:02,116
Something is happening to the island!

320
00:25:06,520 --> 00:25:09,120
The flame clouds, they're fading!

321
00:25:11,700 --> 00:25:12,980
This is it!

322
00:25:13,140 --> 00:25:15,060
Our time's up! It's falling!

323
00:25:21,900 --> 00:25:25,680
Come forth, Flame Clouds!

324
00:25:28,680 --> 00:25:30,100
You're amazing!

325
00:25:30,520 --> 00:25:32,460
That should be enough! Do it!

326
00:25:32,680 --> 00:25:34,000
Stop the island!

327
00:25:34,520 --> 00:25:36,460
You can count on me!

328
00:25:41,680 --> 00:25:42,840
Let's go!

329
00:26:01,120 --> 00:26:05,520
I'll crush every nation under
my heel, just like Wano.

330
00:26:06,060 --> 00:26:07,920
Do you know why you fight?

331
00:26:08,240 --> 00:26:10,358
What kind of world would you create?

332
00:26:11,020 --> 00:26:12,420
Straw Hats!

333
00:26:30,240 --> 00:26:32,500
What do I want?

334
00:26:34,000 --> 00:26:34,840
Lupe!

335
00:26:40,240 --> 00:26:44,120
I want a world where my friends can smile!

336
00:26:48,480 --> 00:26:51,720
Where they can eat until they're full!

337
00:26:52,480 --> 00:26:53,940
Every day!

338
00:27:05,760 --> 00:27:06,760
Quidle!

339
00:27:21,860 --> 00:27:23,177
AHHHHHHHHHHHHHH!!!

340
00:27:23,260 --> 00:27:25,040
AHHH!!!

341
00:28:05,320 --> 00:28:07,500
I said I know who Joy Boy is.

342
00:28:08,360 --> 00:28:09,831
Aren't you curious, King?

343
00:28:11,820 --> 00:28:12,650
Who is it?

344
00:28:13,980 --> 00:28:18,080
He's the man who's going
to defeat me someday.

345
00:28:19,260 --> 00:28:21,520
And maybe he doesn't exist.
